<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.jarvis.chunkless-backfill</string>
    <!--
      Walks an upstream gap the dream cycle cannot close on its own (§6.41,
      confirmed 2026-07-14):

        synthesize_concepts + extract_atoms write pages via engine.putPage(),
        which only touches `pages` — no content_chunks rows. The cycle's Phase 8
        is `embed --stale`, whose predicate is rooted in
        `FROM content_chunks cc JOIN pages p`. A page with zero chunk rows
        contributes zero rows, so the only phase that would have embedded it
        cannot see it — permanently.

      Net at discovery: 9,241 pages (~34% of the brain) invisible to vector
      search, including 100% of atoms (6,739/6,739 — that pipeline had never
      embedded anything). `embed_skip` (the real opt-out) was set on 1 page
      brain-wide, so this is a bug, not intent.

      Fix belongs upstream (src/, which the fork does not patch); this is the
      fork-side stopgap. Delete it if upstream chunks in putPage or roots the
      stale predicate in `pages`.

      07:00 local — after dream-cycle (03:11) so it sweeps the same night's
      synthesized/extracted pages, and BEFORE embedding-label-normalize (08:25),
      which cleans the stale ZE label the embed path stamps on new chunks.
      Capped at 3,000 pages/run so a surprise backlog can't burn the embedding
      quota unattended.

      No secrets (wrapper sources .env.local) → this .plist == .plist.template.

      Manual:  bash scripts/jarvis-chunkless-backfill.sh [--dry] [--max N]
      Verify:  launchctl print "gui/$(id -u)/com.jarvis.chunkless-backfill"
    -->
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/Projects/jarvis-knowledge-os-v2/scripts/jarvis-chunkless-backfill.sh</string>
    </array>
    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql@17/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
        <key>HOME</key>
        <string>/Users/chenyuanquan</string>
    </dict>
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Hour</key>
        <integer>7</integer>
        <key>Minute</key>
        <integer>0</integer>
    </dict>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/.gbrain/chunkless-backfill.stdout.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/.gbrain/chunkless-backfill.stderr.log</string>
    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/Projects/jarvis-knowledge-os-v2</string>
</dict>
</plist>
